Dialogue: 10,0:01:01.51,0:01:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Ohto Ai...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:08.27,0:01:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing in a place like this?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:12.77,0:01:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Walking.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:14.44,0:01:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This late at night?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:17.07,0:01:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh... a dream?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:20.19,0:01:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't like dreams?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:22.03,0:01:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you prefer reality?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:27.41,0:01:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The first time's free.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:29.16,0:01:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,After that, bring your wallet.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:31.33,0:01:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,How much?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:32.42,0:01:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I know you'll like it.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:35.38,0:01:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a special capsule machine, after all.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:38.63,0:01:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Special how?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:41.09,0:01:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It has the thing you want in it.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:43.43,0:01:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't really want anything.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:58.40,0:02:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't lie.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:00.07,0:02:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course you do.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:06.37,0:02:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,A friend.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:34.35,0:02:36.56,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,It wasn't a dream.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:37.73,0:02:40.48,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,I wonder if I should keep it cold.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:42.11,0:02:46.07,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,But if it's alive, maybe I should warm it up.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:48.78,0:02:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:54.16,0:02:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it might end up as a boiled egg.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:58.33,0:02:59.67,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Can I crack it?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:00.50,0:03:04.01,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Actually, {\i0}should{\i1} I crack it?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:09.93,0:03:12.68,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,I'll drop off my bag. You go on ahead.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:12.68,0:03:13.73,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,The usual place?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:13.73,0:03:14.68,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:15.64,0:03:18.56,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Ai! Your teacher is here.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:18.90,0:03:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need to force her to get up, ma'am.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:22.23,0:03:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I just brought this week's printouts.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:25.03,0:03:26.70,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:26.70,0:03:28.32,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,You're always so kind.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:28.32,0:03:29.95,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Oh no, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:29.95,0:03:33.45,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,I'm just stopping by to check on her on my way home.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:31.49,0:03:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what's in it.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:34.87,0:03:37.67,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,I'll try going back there tomorrow.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:55.14,0:03:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going out.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:05.40,0:04:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:08.99,0:04:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:19.96,0:04:23.00,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,What am I doing at school?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:25.22,0:04:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You're overdoing it.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:27.09,0:04:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Any less and she won't get the message.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:29.30,0:04:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, I'll add a bunch more.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:31.76,0:04:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, brutal! Who's overdoing it now?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:41.19,0:04:44.15,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,All of you at school today, a question:
Dialogue: 10,0:04:44.15,0:04:47.90,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,What should you do if someone \Nin your class is being bullied?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:49.11,0:04:51.41,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,You got it! The right answer is:
Dialogue: 10,0:04:51.41,0:04:53.45,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Pretend not to see!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:15.30,0:05:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ohto Ai.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:18.77,0:05:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Break the Egg.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:22.56,0:05:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The Egg?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:23.52,0:05:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The Wonder Egg.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:27.36,0:05:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean this?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.65,0:05:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Quickly, break it.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:30.78,0:05:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's so hard, I can't crack it.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:33.57,0:05:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Break it now!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.53,0:05:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Break it!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:36.71,0:05:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Break it!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:40.33,0:05:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:43.50,0:05:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You're good at this.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:30.46,0:06:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it. Why'd you break it in a place like this?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:37.39,0:06:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're done, leave.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:39.18,0:06:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:43.90,0:06:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Did she have to put it like that?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:46.53,0:06:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate her attitude.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:48.40,0:06:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Just ask normally.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:50.86,0:06:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I said yes, though.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:08.42,0:07:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:09.21,0:07:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:10.34,0:07:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's run!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:11.26,0:07:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:16.97,0:07:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.52,0:07:26.94,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Oh, um, uh...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:25.06,0:07:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to run.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:34.70,0:07:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What are they?!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:35.44,0:07:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You ought to know!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:38.57,0:07:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,They're Seeno Evils!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:42.54,0:07:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:43.66,0:07:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No idea!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.04,0:07:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:52.84,0:07:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,This way!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.13,0:07:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait up!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:12.36,0:08:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this where my liver is?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:14.20,0:08:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I going to be okay?!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:17.45,0:08:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:19.16,0:08:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:35.93,0:08:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:46.56,0:08:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a dream.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:47.94,0:08:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,A bad dream.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:49.52,0:08:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Show me your cut.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:52.07,0:08:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:52.82,0:08:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:57.03,0:08:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gone.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:59.49,0:09:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Mine don't disappear.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:02.53,0:09:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a dream to you, but to me, it's reality.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:06.96,0:09:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, we'll keep running until the bell rings.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:12.25,0:09:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to be scared of.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:14.38,0:09:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,They only come after me.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:17.25,0:09:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, you're immortal in this world.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:20.26,0:09:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as your eyes and heart are okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:23.18,0:09:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that really count as immortal?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:25.51,0:09:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess not.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:27.68,0:09:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, why is this happening to me?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:29.93,0:09:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you bought the Egg.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:31.77,0:09:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't {\i1}buy{\i0} it.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:32.81,0:09:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They said the first one is free.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:35.06,0:09:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Nothing costs more than a free gift, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:39.24,0:09:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not funny.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:40.49,0:09:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you've got no friends.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.20,0:09:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't {\i1}not have{\i0} them; I don't {\i1}need{\i0} them.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:45.91,0:09:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:47.41,0:09:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:48.87,0:09:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't have broken the Egg if it were.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:52.16,0:09:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing to be ashamed of.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:54.46,0:09:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't have any either.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:56.59,0:09:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:57.42,0:09:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the truth.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:59.55,0:10:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I did have superficial ones.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:02.09,0:10:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Friends who would chime in, \N"Totally! Oh, I know! Adorable!"
Dialogue: 10,0:10:09.19,0:10:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,But I didn't have a best friend.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.27,0:10:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Thinking back on it, best friends matter a lot.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:15.56,0:10:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You break up with boyfriends, \Nbut best friends are forever, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:19.78,0:10:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess so.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:22.78,0:10:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You had a boyfriend?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:24.45,0:10:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:25.57,0:10:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I asked first.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:27.91,0:10:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, how about we answer on "go"?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.54,0:10:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:33.29,0:10:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready, go.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:37.84,0:10:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No fair!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:38.96,0:10:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Same to you.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:41.76,0:10:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:43.22,0:10:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:47.60,0:10:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:01.32,0:11:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:02.74,0:11:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Why apologize?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:05.16,0:11:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's their fault.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:09.37,0:11:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:15.25,0:11:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true. They don't attack me.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:20.63,0:11:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't... attack me.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:40.44,0:11:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:24.86,0:12:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Koito?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:36.54,0:12:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Nagase Koito.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:38.75,0:12:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Please be friends with me, everyone.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:41.21,0:12:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Nagase, take the seat next to Ohto.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:44.96,0:12:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:08.61,0:13:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's walk home together.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:10.70,0:13:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:11.82,0:13:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, "Huh"?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:16.08,0:13:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That hurts.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:19.66,0:13:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nice and quiet here, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:25.17,0:13:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:26.96,0:13:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,A game.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:28.46,0:13:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you like games?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:30.76,0:13:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Kind of.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:32.05,0:13:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:33.93,0:13:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What game?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:37.10,0:13:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Ohto?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:40.93,0:13:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,U-Umm,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:43.11,0:13:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think you should hang out with me.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:46.65,0:13:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:48.11,0:13:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,B-Because I'm ugly!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:52.91,0:13:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:54.62,0:13:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not even a little ugly.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:56.83,0:13:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got big, round eyes.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:59.29,0:14:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Your haircut?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:01.00,0:14:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you hide this one?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:12.17,0:14:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's your umbrella?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:14.01,0:14:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot it.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:15.39,0:14:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And your bag?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:18.60,0:14:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:19.81,0:14:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot it.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:22.27,0:14:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:23.52,0:14:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:37.28,0:14:39.99,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Ai, a friend is here to see you.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:40.37,0:14:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not my friend. I don't have friends.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:55.63,0:14:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You forgot these. I came to return them.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:59.43,0:15:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:09.48,0:15:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That's called heterochromia, right? \NWhen your irises are different colors.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:13.91,0:15:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's common in cats and dogs.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:16.87,0:15:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's mysterious.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:18.83,0:15:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't hide it.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:31.30,0:15:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I get bullied for it.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:33.67,0:15:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Always.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:44.18,0:15:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's pretty.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:57.07,0:15:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Be my friend.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:03.87,0:16:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's be best friends.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:07.25,0:16:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,No?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:09.50,0:16:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I... want to, but...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:12.63,0:16:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:15.55,0:16:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,If we could, I'd be happy.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:19.51,0:16:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Me, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:22.35,0:16:23.71,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,It's my fault.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:25.56,0:16:28.76,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Because I betrayed you.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:30.52,0:16:33.48,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Even though you were the first friend I ever made.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:43.49,0:16:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Koito.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:11.60,0:17:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But... But I almost made it until the bell rang!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:18.41,0:17:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sick of this.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:25.78,0:17:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay away!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:38.59,0:17:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Crosswalks are still scary \Neven when you move with the crowd.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:44.39,0:17:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done pretending not to see!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:19.80,0:18:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm mad!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:45.95,0:18:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Saijo Kurumi.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:48.28,0:18:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Ohto Ai.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:49.74,0:18:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai... I guess this is goodbye.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:52.87,0:18:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:55.96,0:18:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget me.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:01.71,0:19:02.59,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:02.93,0:19:04.51,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Only you get saved.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:04.51,0:19:06.68,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,But you have to cheer up
Dialogue: 10,0:19:07.39,0:19:09.55,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,if you want your best friend back.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:10.26,0:19:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:14.64,0:19:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a little warm.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:17.02,0:19:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I protected Kurumi?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:20.49,0:19:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, if I protect a bunch more people, \Nwill Koito come back to life?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:25.74,0:19:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,She will, right?!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:29.99,0:19:32.37,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Ai! Breakfast is ready!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:37.83,0:19:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:40.13,0:19:44.41,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,The weather is lovely today, so don't spend it all in bed.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:45.09,0:19:48.58,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,I hung up the laundry to dry, so take it in this afternoon.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:49.18,0:19:51.29,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Oh, would you look at the time.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:49.85,0:19:52.22,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Oh. I'm immortal there, but...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:52.22,0:19:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a meeting this morning, so I've got to go now.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:57.06,0:19:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Lunch is...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:01.98,0:20:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:03.53,0:20:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know. I have no idea.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:05.65,0:20:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe she snuck out last night and...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:08.45,0:20:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, stay strong.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:10.95,0:20:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Koito...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:32.05,0:20:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi there. How are your injuries?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:34.77,0:20:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll manage.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:36.14,0:20:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And your wallet?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:37.52,0:20:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I brought it.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:39.39,0:20:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,How many rescues to bring Koito back?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:41.94,0:20:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That, I can't say.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:43.98,0:20:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If I protect more at once, will it go that much faster?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:47.44,0:20:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a greedy idiot, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:49.65,0:20:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can't protect them, you won't make it either.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:55.24,0:20:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Koito!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:58.79,0:21:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, your enemies won't always be so easy.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:02.38,0:21:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,They're just Seeno Evils.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:04.59,0:21:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,A disorderly mob.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:07.42,0:21:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:17.56,0:21:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to Kurumi?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:19.77,0:21:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,She's just like your best friend.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:21.77,0:21:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a sculpture in some world.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:24.27,0:21:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And unless her friends go to that \Nworld, she'll stay that way forever.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:28.86,0:21:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Kurumi kill herself, too?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:31.24,0:21:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,No comment.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:53.80,0:21:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:57.26,0:21:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:58.81,0:22:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Acca. The one to your left is Ura-Acca.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:04.06,0:22:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:05.44,0:22:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 10,0:22:06.24,0:22:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,There's someone ahead of you.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:07.52,0:22:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a moment.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:09.41,0:22:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:13.28,0:22:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I'm not the only one?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:26.29,0:22:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That girl...
Dialogue: 10,0:22:28.21,0:22:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:29.63,0:22:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we're always worried about her—
Dialogue: 10,0:22:31.80,0:22:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,She's got an amazing figure!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:33.72,0:22:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:48.32,0:22:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,To be continued.
Comment: 10,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Intro}
Comment: 10,0:02:08.94,0:02:08.94,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Part A}
Comment: 10,0:12:50.92,0:12:50.92,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Part B}
Comment: 10,0:20:16.45,0:20:16.45,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Epilogue}
Comment: 10,0:22:46.93,0:22:46.93,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Next}
